<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Literature Association of Ghana (LITAG)</title>
<meta name="description" content="The Literature Association of Ghana gathers lecturers, teachers, researchers and writers of literature across Ghana. Third Annual International Conference, University of Ghana, 7 to 9 October 2026.">
<link rel="icon" href="data:image/png;base64,">
<meta property="og:title" content="Literature Association of Ghana (LITAG)">
<meta property="og:description" content="Third Annual International Conference in honour of Emeritus Prof. Kofi Anyidoho. Balme Library, University of Ghana, 7 to 9 October 2026.">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Instrument+Serif:ital@0;1&family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;500&family=IBM+Plex+Sans:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root{
    --forest:#0F3B33;
    --forest-deep:#0A2A24;
    --moss:#17564B;
    --brass:#C89A4A;
    --brass-soft:#E3C68F;
    --paper:#EFF1EC;
    --paper-deep:#E3E7E0;
    --ink:#16231F;
    --ink-soft:#4C5D57;
    --line:#CBD5CF;
    --flag-red:#B23A34;
    --shell:min(1180px, 100% - 2.4rem);
    --nav-h:64px;
  }
  *{box-sizing:border-box;}
  html{scroll-behavior:smooth;}
  body{
    margin:0;background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink);
    font-family:"IBM Plex Sans",system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;
    font-size:17px;line-height:1.62;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;
    overflow-x:hidden;
  }
  img{max-width:100%;display:block;}
  a{color:inherit;}
  :focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--brass);outline-offset:3px;}
  .shell{width:var(--shell);margin-inline:auto;}
  .col{max-width:66ch;}

  /* ---- signature motif: kente rule ---- */
  .kente{
    height:7px;width:100%;
    background:repeating-linear-gradient(90deg,
      var(--brass) 0 14px, var(--flag-red) 14px 22px, var(--forest) 22px 36px,
      #E8C874 36px 42px, var(--forest-deep) 42px 56px, var(--brass) 56px 62px);
  }

  /* ---- announcement bar ---- */
  .announce{
    background:var(--forest-deep);color:var(--brass-soft);
    font-family:"IBM Plex Mono",monospace;font-size:.68rem;
    letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;text-align:center;
    padding:.6rem 1rem;
  }
  .announce a{color:#fff;text-decoration:none;border-bottom:1px solid var(--brass);padding-bottom:1px;}
  .announce span{color:var(--brass);}

  /* ---- nav ---- */
  header.top{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:60;background:rgba(239,241,236,.94);backdrop-filter:blur(10px);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);}
  .top-in{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:1rem;height:var(--nav-h);}
  .mark{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.65rem;text-decoration:none;}
  .mark img{width:36px;height:36px;object-fit:contain;}
  .mark b{display:block;font-family:"Instrument Serif",serif;font-weight:400;font-size:1.32rem;line-height:1;}
  .mark i{display:block;font-style:normal;font-family:"IBM Plex Mono",monospace;font-size:.54rem;letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--ink-soft);margin-top:3px;}
  nav.main{display:flex;gap:1.4rem;font-size:.82rem;font-weight:500;align-items:center;}
  nav.main a{text-decoration:none;color:var(--ink-soft);padding:.2rem 0;border-bottom:1.5px solid transparent;}
  nav.main a:hover{color:var(--ink);border-bottom-color:var(--brass);}
  nav.main a.pill{border:1.5px solid var(--forest);color:var(--forest);border-radius:999px;padding:.4rem 1rem;font-weight:600;}
  nav.main a.pill:hover{background:var(--forest);color:#fff;}
  .burger{display:none;background:none;border:1.5px solid var(--ink);border-radius:2px;padding:.45rem .8rem;font-family:"IBM Plex Mono",monospace;font-size:.68rem;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;cursor:pointer;}
  @media(max-width:980px){
    nav.main{
      position:fixed;top:calc(var(--nav-h) + 1px);left:0;right:0;
      flex-direction:column;align-items:stretch;gap:0;
      background:var(--paper);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);
      padding:.5rem 1.2rem 1.2rem;display:none;box-shadow:0 14px 30px rgba(16,35,31,.12);
    }
    nav.main.open{display:flex;}
    nav.main a{padding:.85rem 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);font-size:.95rem;}
    nav.main a.pill{margin-top:.9rem;text-align:center;border-radius:2px;}
    .burger{display:block;}
  }

  /* ---- hero ---- */
  .hero{position:relative;min-height:min(86vh,760px);display:flex;align-items:flex-end;overflow:hidden;background:var(--forest-deep);}
  .hero-bg{position:absolute;inset:0;}
  .hero-bg img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;object-position:center 30%;}
  .hero-bg::after{
    content:"";position:absolute;inset:0;
    background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(10,42,36,.62) 0%, rgba(10,42,36,.72) 45%, rgba(10,42,36,.95) 100%);
  }
  .hero-in{position:relative;z-index:2;width:var(--shell);margin-inline:auto;padding:clamp(3rem,9vw,5.5rem) 0 clamp(2rem,4vw,3rem);color:#fff;}
  .hero-crest{width:clamp(54px,7vw,78px);margin-bottom:1.5rem;}
  .hero-eyebrow{font-family:"IBM Plex Mono",monospace;font-size:.66rem;letter-spacing:.22em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--brass);margin:0 0 1.1rem;}
  h1{font-family:"Instrument Serif",serif;font-weight:400;font-size:clamp(2.5rem,7vw,5rem);line-height:1.02;letter-spacing:-.015em;margin:0;max-width:20ch;}
  h1 em{font-style:italic;color:var(--brass-soft);}
  .hero p.lede{font-family:"Instrument Serif",serif;font-style:italic;font-size:clamp(1.15rem,2.3vw,1.6rem);line-height:1.45;color:rgba(255,255,255,.82);max-width:32ch;margin:1.3rem 0 0;}
  .hero-cta{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.7rem;margin-top:2rem;}
  .btn{display:inline-block;text-decoration:none;font-size:.84rem;font-weight:600;padding:.8rem 1.5rem;border-radius:2px;border:1.5px solid transparent;transition:transform .18s ease,background .18s ease,color .18s ease;}
  .btn.brass{background:var(--brass);color:#14231F;}
  .btn.brass:hover{background:var(--brass-soft);transform:translateY(-2px);}
  .btn.clear{border-color:rgba(255,255,255,.55);color:#fff;}
  .btn.clear:hover{background:#fff;color:var(--forest-deep);transform:translateY(-2px);}
  .btn.dark{background:var(--forest);color:#fff;}
  .btn.dark:hover{background:var(--forest-deep);transform:translateY(-2px);}
  .btn.outline{border-color:var(--ink);color:var(--ink);}
  .btn.outline:hover{background:var(--ink);color:var(--paper);transform:translateY(-2px);}
  .photo-credit{position:absolute;right:1rem;bottom:.55rem;z-index:2;font-family:"IBM Plex Mono",monospace;font-size:.56rem;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:rgba(255,255,255,.55);}

  /* ---- counter strip ---- */
  .strip{background:var(--forest);color:#fff;}
  .strip-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);}
  .strip-grid div{padding:1.5rem 1.3rem;border-left:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.14);}
  .strip-grid div:first-child{border-left:0;}
  .strip dt{font-family:"IBM Plex Mono",monospace;font-size:.6rem;letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--brass);margin-bottom:.4rem;}
  .strip dd{margin:0;font-family:"Instrument Serif",serif;font-size:1.28rem;line-height:1.22;}
  @media(max-width:760px){
    .strip-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;}
    .strip-grid div:nth-child(3){border-left:0;}
    .strip-grid div:nth-child(n+3){border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.14);}
  }

  /* ---- sections ---- */
  section{padding:clamp(3.4rem,7.5vw,6.5rem) 0;}
  .marker{font-family:"IBM Plex Mono",monospace;font-size:.64rem;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--flag-red);margin:0 0 .9rem;}
  h2{font-family:"Instrument Serif",serif;font-weight:400;font-size:clamp(1.95rem,4.5vw,3.05rem);line-height:1.1;margin:0 0 1.4rem;letter-spacing:-.01em;}
  h3{font-size:1.05rem;font-weight:600;margin:0 0 .5rem;}
  p{margin:0 0 1.1rem;}
  .quiet{color:var(--ink-soft);}
  .split{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.22fr .95fr;gap:clamp(2rem,5vw,4.5rem);align-items:start;}
  @media(max-width:920px){.split{grid-template-columns:1fr;}}
  .dark{background:var(--forest);color:#fff;}
  .dark h2,.dark h3{color:#fff;}
  .dark .marker{color:var(--brass);}
  .dark .quiet{color:rgba(255,255,255,.78);}
  .dark-crest{width:44px;margin-bottom:1.3rem;opacity:.9;}
  .tint{background:var(--paper-deep);}

  /* ---- next conference ---- */
  .flyer{border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.3);border-radius:2px;padding:.75rem;background:rgba(255,255,255,.06);}
  .flyer p{font-family:"IBM Plex Mono",monospace;font-size:.58rem;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--brass-soft);margin:.75rem .15rem .15rem;}
  .facts{list-style:none;margin:1.7rem 0 0;padding:0;}
  .facts li{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.4rem 1rem;padding:.8rem 0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.18);font-size:.95rem;}
  .facts b{font-family:"IBM Plex Mono",monospace;font-size:.6rem;letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--brass);min-width:7.5rem;padding-top:.3rem;font-weight:500;}
  .countdown{display:inline-flex;align-items:baseline;gap:.5rem;margin-top:1.6rem;padding:.5rem 1rem;border:1px solid var(--brass);border-radius:999px;}
  .countdown b{font-family:"Instrument Serif",serif;font-size:1.6rem;color:var(--brass-soft);line-height:1;}
  .countdown span{font-family:"IBM Plex Mono",monospace;font-size:.62rem;letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--brass);}
  .keynotes{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:1.5rem;margin-top:3rem;}
  @media(max-width:880px){.keynotes{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:1.2rem;}}
  .keynote{background:rgba(255,255,255,.055);border-top:2px solid var(--brass);padding:1.3rem 1.2rem;border-radius:0 0 2px 2px;}
  .keynote .kn{font-family:"Instrument Serif",serif;font-size:1.38rem;line-height:1.18;margin-bottom:.5rem;}
  .keynote small{display:block;font-size:.81rem;color:rgba(255,255,255,.74);line-height:1.5;}

  /* ---- about with photo ---- */
  .about-photo{border-radius:2px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:10px 10px 0 rgba(15,59,51,.14);}
  .about-photo img{aspect-ratio:4/5;object-fit:cover;width:100%;}
  .about-photo figcaption{font-family:"IBM Plex Mono",monospace;font-size:.58rem;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--ink-soft);padding:.7rem .2rem 0;background:var(--paper);}
  .chips{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.45rem;margin:1.5rem 0 0;padding:0;list-style:none;}
  .chips li{font-family:"IBM Plex Mono",monospace;font-size:.7rem;letter-spacing:.06em;border:1px solid var(--forest);color:var(--forest);border-radius:999px;padding:.32rem .85rem;}
  .fill{border-bottom:1.5px dotted var(--flag-red);color:var(--flag-red);}
  .dark .fill{border-color:var(--brass-soft);color:var(--brass-soft);}

  /* ---- gallery mosaic ---- */
  .mosaic{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(6,1fr);gap:.8rem;margin-top:2.6rem;}
  .mosaic figure{margin:0;position:relative;overflow:hidden;border-radius:2px;background:var(--paper-deep);cursor:zoom-in;}
  .mosaic img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;transition:transform .55s ease;}
  .mosaic figure:hover img{transform:scale(1.05);}
  .mosaic figcaption{
    position:absolute;inset:auto 0 0 0;padding:1.4rem .9rem .7rem;
    background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(10,42,36,0),rgba(10,42,36,.82));
    color:#fff;font-family:"IBM Plex Mono",monospace;font-size:.58rem;
    letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;opacity:0;transition:opacity .3s ease;
  }
  .mosaic figure:hover figcaption{opacity:1;}
  .m-a{grid-column:span 4;aspect-ratio:16/10;}
  .m-b{grid-column:span 2;aspect-ratio:3/4;}
  .m-c{grid-column:span 2;aspect-ratio:4/3;}
  @media(max-width:780px){
    .mosaic{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:.6rem;}
    .m-a,.m-b,.m-c{grid-column:span 2;aspect-ratio:3/2;}
    .mosaic figcaption{opacity:1;}
  }
  .credit{font-family:"IBM Plex Mono",monospace;font-size:.6rem;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--ink-soft);margin-top:1.2rem;}

  /* ---- lightbox ---- */
  .lb{position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:90;background:rgba(10,42,36,.96);display:none;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:3.5rem 1.2rem;}
  .lb.open{display:flex;}
  .lb img{max-width:min(1120px,94vw);max-height:80vh;object-fit:contain;border-radius:2px;}
  .lb .lb-cap{position:absolute;left:0;right:0;bottom:1.3rem;text-align:center;color:rgba(255,255,255,.8);font-family:"IBM Plex Mono",monospace;font-size:.62rem;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;padding:0 1rem;}
  .lb button{position:absolute;background:none;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.45);color:#fff;font-family:"IBM Plex Mono",monospace;font-size:.72rem;letter-spacing:.14em;padding:.55rem .95rem;border-radius:2px;cursor:pointer;}
  .lb button:hover{background:rgba(255,255,255,.14);}
  #lbClose{top:1.1rem;right:1.2rem;}
  #lbPrev{left:1.2rem;top:50%;transform:translateY(-50%);}
  #lbNext{right:1.2rem;top:50%;transform:translateY(-50%);}
  @media(max-width:620px){#lbPrev{left:.6rem;}#lbNext{right:.6rem;}}

  /* ---- timeline ---- */
  .timeline{list-style:none;margin:2.4rem 0 0;padding:0;}
  .timeline li{display:grid;grid-template-columns:7rem 1fr;gap:1.6rem;padding:1.4rem 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line);}
  .timeline li:last-child{border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);}
  .timeline .yr{font-family:"IBM Plex Mono",monospace;font-size:.76rem;letter-spacing:.1em;color:var(--flag-red);padding-top:.35rem;}
  .timeline h3{font-family:"Instrument Serif",serif;font-weight:400;font-size:1.32rem;margin-bottom:.3rem;}
  .timeline p{font-size:.93rem;color:var(--ink-soft);margin:0;}
  @media(max-width:600px){.timeline li{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:.35rem;}}

  /* ---- projects ---- */
  .projects{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:1.3rem;margin-top:2.6rem;}
  @media(max-width:920px){.projects{grid-template-columns:1fr;}}
  .project{background:var(--paper);border:1px solid var(--forest);border-radius:2px;padding:1.7rem 1.5rem;transition:transform .2s ease,box-shadow .2s ease;}
  .project:hover{transform:translateY(-4px);box-shadow:7px 7px 0 var(--brass);}
  .project .tag{font-family:"IBM Plex Mono",monospace;font-size:.6rem;letter-spacing:.18em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--flag-red);display:block;margin-bottom:.85rem;}
  .project h3{font-family:"Instrument Serif",serif;font-weight:400;font-size:1.45rem;margin-bottom:.6rem;}
  .project p{font-size:.93rem;color:var(--ink-soft);margin:0;}

  /* ---- people ---- */
  .people{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:1.4rem 2.8rem;margin-top:2.2rem;}
  @media(max-width:760px){.people{grid-template-columns:1fr;}}
  .person{border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-top:.95rem;}
  .person .role{font-family:"IBM Plex Mono",monospace;font-size:.6rem;letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--ink-soft);margin-bottom:.3rem;}
  .person .name{font-family:"Instrument Serif",serif;font-size:1.3rem;line-height:1.2;}
  .person p{font-size:.89rem;color:var(--ink-soft);margin:.4rem 0 0;}
  .card{border-top:2px solid var(--ink);padding-top:1.05rem;}
  .card h3{font-family:"IBM Plex Mono",monospace;font-size:.64rem;letter-spacing:.18em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--ink-soft);}
  .card ul{margin:0;padding-left:1.05rem;font-size:.94rem;color:var(--ink-soft);}
  .card li{margin-bottom:.42rem;}

  /* ---- join ---- */
  .steps{counter-reset:step;margin:2rem 0 0;padding:0;list-style:none;}
  .steps li{counter-increment:step;position:relative;padding-left:3.1rem;margin-bottom:1.4rem;max-width:56ch;}
  .steps li::before{content:counter(step,decimal-leading-zero);position:absolute;left:0;top:.05rem;font-family:"IBM Plex Mono",monospace;font-size:.76rem;color:var(--brass);border:1px solid var(--brass);border-radius:50%;width:2.05rem;height:2.05rem;display:grid;place-items:center;}
  .steps strong{display:block;font-size:1rem;margin-bottom:.2rem;}
  .steps span{font-size:.93rem;color:rgba(255,255,255,.78);}

  /* ---- footer ---- */
  footer{background:var(--forest-deep);color:#fff;padding:clamp(2.8rem,6vw,4.2rem) 0 2rem;}
  .foot-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.4fr 1fr 1fr;gap:2.4rem;}
  @media(max-width:860px){.foot-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:1.8rem;}}
  footer h4{font-family:"IBM Plex Mono",monospace;font-size:.62rem;letter-spacing:.18em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--brass);margin:0 0 .85rem;font-weight:500;}
  footer p,footer li{color:rgba(255,255,255,.76);font-size:.89rem;}
  footer ul{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0;}
  footer li{margin-bottom:.45rem;}
  footer a{color:#fff;text-decoration:none;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(200,154,74,.6);}
  footer a:hover{color:var(--brass);}
  .foot-mark{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.85rem;margin-bottom:1rem;}
  .foot-mark img{width:42px;}
  .foot-mark span{font-family:"Instrument Serif",serif;font-size:1.5rem;line-height:1.15;}
  .colophon{margin-top:2.6rem;padding-top:1.3rem;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.16);font-size:.76rem;color:rgba(255,255,255,.55);}

  /* ---- motion ---- */
  .rise{opacity:0;transform:translateY(18px);transition:opacity .7s ease,transform .7s ease;}
  .rise.seen{opacity:1;transform:none;}
  @media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){
    html{scroll-behavior:auto;}
    .rise{opacity:1;transform:none;transition:none;}
    .project:hover,.btn:hover,.mosaic figure:hover img{transform:none;}
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="announce">
  Third Annual International Conference <span>&bull;</span> Balme Library, University of Ghana <span>&bull;</span> 7 to 9 October 2026 <span>&bull;</span> <a href="#next">Details</a>
</div>
<div class="kente"></div>

<header class="top">
  <div class="shell top-in">
    <a class="mark" href="#top">
      <img src="data:image/png;base64," alt="">
      <span><b>LITAG</b><i>Literature Association of Ghana</i></span>
    </a>
    <button class="burger" id="burger" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="nav">Menu</button>
    <nav class="main" id="nav">
      <a href="#next">Conference 2026</a>
      <a href="#about">About</a>
      <a href="#gallery">Gallery</a>
      <a href="#record">Record</a>
      <a href="#projects">Projects</a>
      <a href="#people">People</a>
      <a class="pill" href="#join">Join</a>
    </nav>
  </div>
</header>

<main id="top">

  <!-- HERO -->
  <div class="hero">
    <div class="hero-bg">
      <img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Members and dignitaries of the Literature Association of Ghana at the University of Cape Coast">
    </div>
    <div class="hero-in">
      <img class="hero-crest" src="data:image/png;base64," alt="The LITAG symbol, a watchful eye">
      <p class="hero-eyebrow">Founded 2022, Cape Coast</p>
      <h1>Literature Association of <em>Ghana</em></h1>
      <p class="lede">A national body for the people who study, teach, research and write literature in Ghana.</p>
      <div class="hero-cta">
        <a class="btn brass" href="#next">The 2026 conference</a>
        <a class="btn clear" href="#join">Become a member</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <span class="photo-credit">Photograph, University of Cape Coast</span>
  </div>
  <div class="kente"></div>

  <!-- STRIP -->
  <div class="strip">
    <div class="shell">
      <dl class="strip-grid">
        <div><dt>Formed</dt><dd>2022, Department of English, University of Cape Coast</dd></div>
        <div><dt>President</dt><dd>Prof. Yaw Sekyi-Baidoo</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Conferences held</dt><dd>KNUST 2024, Cape Coast 2025</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Disciplines</dt><dd>Literature, Ghanaian Languages, French, English</dd></div>
      </dl>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- NEXT CONFERENCE -->
  <section id="next" class="dark">
    <div class="shell">
      <div class="split">
        <div class="col">
          <img class="dark-crest" src="data:image/png;base64," alt="">
          <p class="marker rise">Third Annual International Conference</p>
          <h2 class="rise">Literature as a Construct of National and Pan African Identity</h2>
          <p class="quiet rise">The association holds its third annual international conference in honour of Emeritus Prof. Kofi Anyidoho, whose opening keynote launched the maiden conference in 2024. Three days of keynote addresses and parallel sessions run at the Balme Library, University of Ghana.</p>
          <div class="countdown rise" id="countdown" hidden><b id="cdNum">0</b><span id="cdWord">days to go</span></div>
          <ul class="facts rise">
            <li><b>In honour of</b><span>Emeritus Prof. Kofi Anyidoho</span></li>
            <li><b>Dates</b><span>Wednesday 7 to Friday 9 October 2026</span></li>
            <li><b>Venue</b><span>Balme Library, University of Ghana, Legon</span></li>
            <li><b>Abstracts</b><span class="fill">[Insert deadline and submission email]</span></li>
            <li><b>Registration</b><span class="fill">[Insert fee and payment details]</span></li>
          </ul>
